      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why im typing this but i just feel so stuck. everything i do feels like i'm just running in place but the treadmill is getting faster and faster. i've worked so hard for years and for what? just more debt, more pressure, and more people expecting things from me that i literally can't give anymore. i feel like i'm just a machine that's running out of fuel and there's no way to recharge. i'm just... so tired of everything.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
