      "content": "letting go of responsibilities just feels like a fantasy. the world doesn't let you just 'stop' without everything falling apart. if i stop, my life is ruined. if i keep going, i'm just dying inside anyway. it feels like there's no actual way to get peace. like, is there even a version of reality where the noise actually stops permanently?",
